Package: offlineatlas
Type: Package
Title: Standalone Offline Maps and Networks
Version: 0.0.13
Authors@R: person("Keith A.", "Preble", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "preblek25@ecu.edu")
Description: Creates interactive geographic maps and network visualizations
    as standalone HTML files that work without an internet connection,
    a server, or a running R session. Accepts data frames and geographic
    features supplied through 'sf'. Supports numeric and categorical area
    maps, geographic and schematic networks, time-series playback, and
    country history charts. Provides configurable legends and controls,
    optional lossless compression, and figure and data downloads.
    Creates customizable static maps and network figures through 'ggplot2'.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: jsonlite, xml2, grid, sf (>= 1.0-0), ggplot2 (>= 3.5.0),
    igraph (>= 2.0.0), ggrepel (>= 0.9.8)
Suggests: knitr, rmarkdown
VignetteBuilder: knitr
URL: https://preblek.github.io/offlineatlas/, https://github.com/preblek/offlineatlas
BugReports: https://github.com/preblek/offlineatlas/issues
Config/Needs/website: pkgdown
